The Atlas engine is fetched at build time from Enntity/atlas at the commit in
install/atlas-source.json (AGPL-3.0-only): Atlas-Inf plus SparkGLM's GLM-5.3
Flash work.

The overlay converter's NVFP4 quantization kernel is copied unchanged from
Mango-kid/atlas (AGPL-3.0-only); see install/converter/provenance.json.

FlashKDA by MoonshotAI (MIT, LICENSES/MIT-FlashKDA.txt) is fetched and patched
at build time; install/flash_kda/flash_kda_sm121_slots.patch carries both MIT
and AGPL terms.

bench/four_stream_video.py is Apache-2.0, copyright contributors to the vLLM
project (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).

FlashInfer (Apache-2.0), including NVIDIA's sparse-MLA prefill source, and
CUTLASS (BSD-3-Clause) are fetched at build time; the image ships their notices
under /opt/atlas/notices/.

SparkGLM grew out of MiaAI-Lab's GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks recipe (MIT).
The vLLM-era tree, with its complete notices and attributions, is preserved at
the tag vllm-final.

Model weights are not distributed in this repository. They remain under their
publishers' licenses; the DFlash2 drafter is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 (non-commercial).
See docs/LICENSING.md.
